IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wills-making`

-- Wills Act 1970 (WA), ss 6, 7, 8, 10, 11, 13 (deleted), 14, 14A, 15, 20, 26, 27, 32 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wills-act-1970.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts used: Chloe born 14 March 2003 (wa-cradle-to-grave-chloe facts.json), turns 18 on 2021-03-14 (c025); Liam born
-- 22 July 1999; Chloe and Liam married 2029-05-18 (c054) and make wills 2041-02-14 (c082); Chloe's father dies 2052-08-25 (c087;
-- Jake's k084 dates it 2052-08-19) with a will leaving everything to Sue; Liam dies 2083-02-09 (c096); Chloe dies 2088-11-02 leaving
-- her estate to Oliver and Ella equally (c098); Jake's divorce takes effect 2039-08-20 (he made no will; the case is hypothetical).

